rooms_desc ({"You are standing in Vector's wonderfully decorated living room.It was inspired by non-other than Saffrin.  It is decorated inan Old English Style.  The floor is a tan, stained, hard-wood.The couch looks sooo comfortable.  You want to restthere so bad.  At the edge of the room you see a sticker on the wall.","You are now standing in Vector's bedroom.  This is where VectorSpends all of his nights dreaming about Hootie.  (All ofThe dreams are good, of course! =)).  The room is decoratedIn a plain white items.  It is very plain looking.  YouNotice a bed, a lamp, and a picture on the nightstand.","This is Vector's Treasure Room.  This is where he hideshis items when he leaves.  If a reboot happens, they willbe lost, though.  If you wish to keep something in here,please ask Vector and he may or maynot give you permission.","You are standing in Vector's Kitchen.  The floor is ablack and white tile.  The cabinets are made of a light stained woodand the counter tops are a pale white.  The smell of desserts fill yournostrils. You notice a refridgerator, and oven, a microwave, and a sink.","You are standing in Vector's Bathroom.  If you had toomuch to drink last Saturday, then this is the place for you!It has all of the new toilet features to give relief of hangovers.(Well, not really, but Vector seems to think so.)  You noticea toilet, a sink, a tub, and a bag.",0,0,0,0,0,})
rooms_short ({"Vector's beautiful livingroom.","Vector's Bedroom","Vector's Treasure Room","Vector's Kitchen","Vector's Bathroom",0,0,0,0,0,})
