items ({({"sticker","This room has the official Saffrin Seal Of Approval (TM)",}),({"picture","You see Vector's picture of Hootie.  He loves her dearly and keeps this picture beside his bed so he will have sweetdreams",}),0,({"refridgerator","This is where Vector's keeps all of his food and no telling what else.","oven","This is where Vector's cooks his food.  It is very hot.","microwave","This is where Vector cooks his food if he wants it to look like rubber","sink","This is Vector's Sink.  What else is there to say.",}),({"toilet","You do not want to know about this object!!","sink","Vector's sink has the trace of dried up tooth paste.","tub","No telling what all has gone on here. =)","bag","You almost blow chunks when you see what's inside.  It's Izekiel's barf bag!",}),0,0,0,0,0,})
